    *
    * @exampleSql Bulk Upsert your data
    * ```sql
    * create table
    *   instruments (id int8 primary key, name text);
    *
    * insert into
    *   instruments (id, name)
    * values
    *   (1, 'harpsichord');
    * ```
    *
    * @exampleResponse Bulk Upsert your data
    * ```json
    * {
    *   "data": [
    *     {
    *       "id": 1,
    *       "name": "piano"
    *     },
    *     {
    *       "id": 2,
    *       "name": "harp"
    *     }
    *   ],
    *   "status": 201,
    *   "statusText": "Created"
